{"version":1,"content":"<p>科學家發現一種前所未見的銀晶體結構，其化學活性遠高於常見的銀。日本北海道大學研究團隊在電子束作用下分解碘化銀時，觀察到銀原子以極罕見的簡單立方方式排列，並迅速與氧反應生成氧化銀。相關成果已發表於《納米快報》。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587866.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T19:24:21.154569+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T19:16:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T19:17:33.609906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T19:17:33.609906+00:00","content_hash":"77cb1db16ca90341e11cf268c06109b410ce75da6372e9ef38b84483942ccb94","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}